      "raw": "Fact and dimension tables form the foundation for all reporting conducted within Insights+.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Fact and dimension tables form the foundation for all reporting conducted within Insights+.",
      "target": {
